1. NOT LEGAL COUNSEL:
   CompliRules is an automated Abstract Syntax Tree (AST) heuristic and developer
   guardrail tool. It does NOT constitute legal, financial, accounting, or
   certified cybersecurity advice. Use of CompliRules does not create an
   attorney-client or auditor-client relationship.

2. ZERO LIABILITY FOR FINES & BREACHES:
   Under no circumstances shall the authors, maintainers, or contributors be held
   liable for any administrative fines, regulatory sanctions (including but not
   limited to penalties levied under GDPR, KVKK, HIPAA, BIPA, CCPA, or EU AI Act),
   data breaches, security incidents, loss of goodwill, or legal costs arising from
   reliance upon the heuristic checks, primitives, or documentation provided herein.

3. MANDATORY INDEPENDENT AUDIT:
   Automated rules cannot replace mandatory Data Protection Officer (DPO) audits,
   formal Penetration Testing (Pentest), or statutory regulatory filings (such as
   VERBİS or ROPA registers). Production systems processing sensitive personal data
   MUST be reviewed and certified by licensed human professionals.
